    "sub_ename": "GUIDANCE ON PRACTICAL SUBJECTS",
    "describe_ch": "以實務應用為核心，針對學生想從事之專題方向，學程協助聘請適當之業師群，指導其實作之能力，並以實務報告或作品為產出之成果。",
    "describe_eh": "Oriented on a practical application, depending on students’ focus, this program will find some suitable mentors for guiding the students on their direction. The outcome will be a practical report or a simplified product.",
